@startuml domain-class
' Domain model for the terminal version.
' Changes since Meeting 2:
'   - Contributor entity removed. Assignment is User to Issue, not per project.
'   - Comment added as a first-class entity.
'   - estimateMinutes / loggedMinutes removed with the time-tracking feature.

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #AEDCF0
  BorderColor #333333
}
hide methods

class User {
  userId : string
  githubId : long long
  username : string
  displayName : string
  avatarUrl : string
}

class Project {
  projectId : string
  projectName : string
}

class Issue {
  issueId : string
  issueNumber : int
  issueTitle : string
  issueDescription : string
  issueStatus : enum {open, closed}
}

class Label {
  labelId : string
  labelName : string
  labelDescription : string
}

class Comment {
  commentId : string
  text : string
  createdAt : unix time
}

Project "1" *-- "*" Issue        : contains
Issue   "*" -- "*" Label         : categorised by
Issue   "*" -- "*" User          : assigned to
Issue   "1" *-- "*" Comment      : has
User    "1" -- "*" Issue          : creates

note bottom of Comment
  Comments currently store no author.
  Known gap, see report section 5.
end note

@enduml
